{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A virtual pet device in the corner of your screen! Feed and play with your pet while you work or play for dopamine boosts that makes even mundane tasks a little more fun! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As you feed and play with your pets, they will slowly start improving their stats, allowing them to evolve. Meticulously fill out your encyclopedia or just explore and find your favorites!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Features of this game include:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A minimizable display, to keep the game out of your way while you work</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A wide variety of pets to discover and play with</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A series of minigames that scale in difficulty with your pet</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An optional productivity mode that slows down the game to keep you focused</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3704130?t=1746543415","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3704130/515fce94ecbc671dddc4929664ff831370d62a95/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1746543415","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3704130/d0bd04ad2865bce43a94d4a2f220aad5f9cec9dc/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746543415","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3704130/d0bd04ad2865bce43a94d4a2f220aad5f9cec9dc/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746543415","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A virtual pet device in the corner of your screen! Feed and play with your pet while you work or play for dopamine boosts that makes even mundane tasks a little more fun! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As you feed and play with your pets, they will slowly start improvi